{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/pulls/868","id":5238348093,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTty1_c8AAAABODrZPQ","html_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/pull/868","diff_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/pull/868.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/pull/868.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/issues/868","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/pulls/868/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/pulls/868/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/issues/868/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/statuses/da002c3227e92d625a73b26706420fab32cdf2d8","number":868,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"fix(research): bound dynamic-participation CLI input reads","user":{"login":"ProfHepta","id":102159240,"node_id":"U_kgDOBhbTiA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102159240?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ProfHepta","html_url":"https://github.com/ProfHepta","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ProfHepta/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ProfHepta/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ProfHepta/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ProfHepta/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ProfHepta/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ProfHepta/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ProfHepta/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ProfHepta/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ProfHepta/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Problem\n\nThe dynamic-participation research CLI checked pathname size before an unbounded\n`read_text`. A FIFO with no writer could block the process before its finite\ninput/event contract ran; the earlier stat also did not bind the bytes read.\n\n## Change\n\nUse the repository's existing bounded, nonblocking, no-follow regular-file reader.\nRetain the original finite JSON/event semantics and qualification refusal.\nAdd six real CLI controls for the exact byte ceiling plus one, FIFO, leaf/ancestor\nsymlinks, directory/missing inputs, invalid UTF-8 and unchanged ordinary output.\nAppend the sole development plan and preserve a complete finite evidence packet.\n\nThis is stacked on #843 at `0ff81958a611d2c0be54d2ca839b955ae7cb2772`. It changes two Python\nfiles, the sole plan, and evidence. It changes no native consensus rules.\n\n## Validation and identity\n\nExecuted source: **`8d4c915939f2ae7659e254ec3475d2dadb919f2a`**, tree `9ed7a23f58cb427fe45b23bf01bf07bf4fca4fbf`.\nEvidence-only head: **`da002c3227e92d625a73b26706420fab32cdf2d8`**, tree `4e205ea8d4a1a9f30f7bcaa81272b33c42dbaca9`.\nThe original recorder verified all tracked bytes before and after each command.\n\n- Dynamic-participation tests: **34/34 passed**, including all 28 original methods.\n- Source-integrity tests: **43/43 passed**.\n- Real FIFO comparison: original exact-source process exceeded its one-second\n  observation budget; repaired CLI returned structured REFUSED / HOLD_NO_GO,\n  exit 2, with the native six-successor risk bound still null.\n- Repository, CI-contract, locked/offline Cargo graph and formatting: passed.\n- Strict workspace/all-target/all-feature Clippy: **not passed**; the explicit\n  120-second timeout returned 124. The incomplete raw log is retained.\n- No native campaign, WAN service, cryptographic security or activation is claimed.\n  CP/CG/CQ and six-confirmation risk remain unproved; overall HOLD_NO_GO remains.\n\n[Full finite evidence](https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/tree/da002c3227e92d625a73b26706420fab32cdf2d8/evidence/pon-dynamic-input-bound-20261110-685a)\nincludes the prior partial-checkout failure and the new complete-worktree receipts.\nThe evidence-only head does not borrow a new execution claim from the source commit.\nDraft retained; no merge or production activation.\n\n\n## Publication completeness follow-up\n\nThe first evidence publication at `9b4c6866b846c74fd9d827225e6ce66eb0bcdec3` omitted 32 original log files\nbecause the existing ignore rule excluded `.log` files from ordinary staging.\nThe original head and incomplete manifest remain in Git history. The follow-up\nchecks all original lengths and SHA256 values, explicitly stages only those\nmanifest-bound logs, and records the omission in `publication-history.json`.\n\nThe complete packet now has **48 files**. Every manifest member was read from\nthe final committed Git tree and matched by length and SHA256; all 48 remote\nGitHub blob identities and paths were independently matched to that verified\ntree. No tests were rerun or newly attributed to this evidence-only follow-up.\nClippy remains **not passed**, exit 124. Source execution identity remains\n`8d4c915939f2ae7659e254ec3475d2dadb919f2a`; the final evidence head is `da002c3227e92d625a73b26706420fab32cdf2d8`.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-10T08:40:02Z","updated_at":"2026-11-10T09:06:44Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"fce8c9e1621c7969f2a30d01e20c5b1b9e753b35","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"TrillionniumFoundation:fix/chain-dynamic-input-bound-20261110-685a","ref":"fix/chain-dynamic-input-bound-20261110-685a","repo":{"id":1323087357,"node_id":"R_kgDOTty1_Q","name":"Trillionnium-Chain","full_nam